    "R5 Equal-rank disagreement refuses the build.",
    "R6 Spelling variants relocate one stem onto another.",
    "R7 An ambiguous class takes the stem, its spelling variants, the formals it abbreviates, and diminutives OF THE STEM.  v1 chains that land elsewhere are listed under r3_chain_consequences.",
